# Build tooling update

Update the build tools in dxos and edge to the latest stable versions that are at least one week old.

## Extensions

| Term       | URI                          |
| ---------- | ---------------------------- |
| `question` | `org.dxos.mdl.question@1.0` |
| `decision` | `org.dxos.mdl.decision@1.0` |
| `goal`     | `org.dxos.mdl.goal@1.0`     |
| `pr`       | `org.dxos.mdl.pr@1.0`       |
| `event`    | `org.dxos.mdl.event@1.0`    |

## Goals

```mdl
goal G-1: Update the edge build tools.
  status: review
  notes:
    - Pnpm 12.22.0, moon 2.6.5, vite 8.3.8, vitest 4.1.12 and wrangler 4.163.
    - Node stays at 24.11.1. Node 24.22 has a SQLite that rejects ECHO queries.
    - Unused jest, mocha, swc and ts-node packages are removed.
    - Lint and build are clean on all 52 projects.
```

```mdl
goal G-2: Update the dxos build tools.
  status: review
  notes:
    - Same toolchain as edge. Wrangler 4.116 is the last release on miniflare 4.
    - The two vitest patches apply to 4.1.12 without change.
    - Lint and build are clean on all projects.
```

```mdl
goal G-3: Run the full test suites in both repositories.
  status: started
  notes:
    - The edge tests and the dxos node tests run locally now.
    - CI runs on both pull requests.
```

```mdl
goal G-4: Make ECHO queries work with the SQLite in node 24.22.
  status: backlog
  notes:
    - SQLite 3.54 stops with "VIEWs and/or subqueries nested too deep".
    - Node can move to 24.22 after this change.
```

```mdl
goal G-5: Turn on the new React Compiler lint rules again.
  status: backlog
  notes:
    - The rules are off in both repositories because current code does not obey them.
```

```mdl
goal G-6: Move sandbox-service to the new Artifacts API.
  status: backlog
  notes:
    - Edge keeps workers-types at 5.20260719 until this change.
```

## Pull requests

```mdl
pr PR-1: Update the edge build tools.
  ref: dxos/edge#1576
  goals: [G-1, G-3]
```

```mdl
pr PR-3: Hold node at 24.11.1 in edge.
  ref: dxos/edge#1577
  status: landing
  goals: [G-1]
```

```mdl
pr PR-2: Update the dxos build tools.
  ref: dxos/dxos#14666
  status: landing
  goals: [G-2, G-3]
```

